    "description": "Usual replies manaki manam chepukunevi,⁣⁣⁣\nExams ah? ‘Repu chaduvudham.’⁣⁣⁣\nGym ah? ‘Repu chedham.’⁣⁣⁣\nWork ah? ‘Repu chudham.’ ⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nManam yentha yedavalam ante, ‘repu’ ane matani ‘rape’ chesese rakham. ⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nChudu mitrama, mee amma babu, gudiki velle rakaalu, ante mostly middle class bathukulu. Kashtala thone perigeru, kashtallone potharu. Nuvu aina kashtanni gelavali ani korukuntaru. ⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nKani mana daridrapu mindset yela untundhi ante US Visa free ga ravali, US lo pizza thinali anukuntam. Kashtalu osthe matram, Vitamin D ledhu ante injection veyinchukunentha easy ga solution ocheyali antam.⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nM1 exam teliyakunda pass ipoyi, M1 professor la behave cheyatam yentha thappo, kashtallo unapudu kashtapadalenu ane alochanlu kuda anthe thappu. Aidhu velu sampadichatam, aidhu vellatho thinnantha easy kadhu mitrama. Biscuit latho bhojanalu chesi kadupu nimpukune vallu naku bochudu mandi telusu. ⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nAla ani cheppi, ipuduki ipudu nuvu vijetha cinema lo Chiranjeevi laga, family kosam kidney daanalu cheyyakarledhu. Kudhirinapudala thinu, thirugu, preminchu, kashtapadu. Nuvu entha yedava aina, maximum neekem kakunda chusukotaniki naluguru untaru. Kani vallaki edaina ithe nuvu chusukune shakti neelo undali ga?⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nP.S 1: Kashtapakanda nee mobile screen meeda sunny leone osthundhemo kani, sannaga matram avvavu. ⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nP.S 2: Kashtapadithene sukhalu untaya? Sukhalu telidhu kani, viluvalu ithe kachitanga untai. ⁣⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nP.S 3: Netflix lo account thisukoni lust stories chuse manam, mana life ki accountability aina lakshyam meedha matram lust chupincham. *Slow standing ovation⁣*⁣⁣\n⁣⁣⁣\nP.S 4: Mari rich class vallu gudiki vellaru, balupu ani udheshisthunava ani Indian cinema lani Bangladesh lo amukune vallala adagamakandi. Ipudu answer sheet lo full stop petaledhu ani teacher ninnu fail cheyatam entha thappo, matter chadiveka ilanti brilliant doubts adagatam kuda anthe thappu. Jai Hind. #fakemuchatlu",
